	'k347d117e' => 'The report identifies operational risks that could trigger unbudgeted downtime and outlines a tailored maintenance recommendation, detailing whether quarterly or monthly attendances suit your plant. Finally, the report provides a fixed first-year contract price valid for thirty days. The 190-euro survey fee is credited in full against your first annual invoice upon contract approval.',
