	'k4281d5bd' => 'Every survey hour is conducted personally by our contract manager Leila Haddad alongside an experienced service technician. The visit follows a rigorous five-stage schedule. Minutes 0 to 10 are spent walking the property with your facilities manager, reviewing past operating issues and examining existing maintenance records. From minutes 10 to 30, we access the roof and central plant room to inspect every unit, transcribe manufacturer nameplates, and evaluate physical wear.',
