	'k8af67aba' => 'Monthly drain check',
	'k8b077331' => 'Every survey hour is conducted personally by our contract manager Leila Haddad alongside an experienced service technician. Leila Haddad leads every survey hour, together with one service technician.',
	'k8b5ab8a3' => 'How are maintenance fees invoiced and paid?',
	'k8b757c12' => 'After 11:00',
	'k8bf9e23d' => 'A target, never a guarantee',
	'k8c27b358' => 'Before proposing a maintenance contract, we conduct a structured sixty-minute technical evaluation of your building\'s HVAC plant. For 190 euros excl. VAT—credited in full against your first contract year—our contract manager and a technician inspect your equipment and deliver a comprehensive written report.',
	'k8d648545' => 'Co-founder, since 2009',
	'k8d7bc26e' => 'Roof and plant room: every unit, its nameplate and its condition, written down one by one.',
	'k8d9c307c' => 'N',
	'k8dae1a11' => 'Thank you for requesting a survey hour with Kuki Climate B.V. We have received your submission and are preparing our technical review for your commercial premises.',
	'k8de71481' => 'Our contract fees cover all scheduled labor, travel, preventative diagnostics, routine lubrication, filter inspections, and seasonal adjustments. Consumable replacement parts, including drive belts, contactors, and fresh filter media, are supplied at direct cost and itemised on the service report before installation.',
	'k8e49b85d' => 'Within 2 working days',
	'k8f05cd05' => 'Co-founder and managing engineer<br>Sets the engineering standard<br>and signs every maintenance contract',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k90286048' => 'Kuki Climate B.V.<br>Koelhuisweg 14<br>3089 KN Rotterdam, Netherlands',
	'k9030e39f' => 'Monthly',
	'k90998f70' => 'What you receive',
	'k9295f502' => 'Request a survey hour',
	'k95295adf' => 'Condition grade for each unit, A to D',
	'k9539f6b3' => 'Lead service technician<br>Rooftop condensers and air-handling units<br>from the first visit of the year to the last',
	'k971665b7' => 'The seven people at the depot',
	'k979031fe' => 'Commercial office blocks of four to twelve floors rely on complex rooftop condensers and central plant rooms that occupants expect to work silently in the background. Typical installations combine rooftop chillers, air-handling units, and ceiling cassettes distributed across tenanted floors.',
	'k97b925c2' => 'Contract length<br>Twelve months, renewed each year<br>unless you give notice',
	'k9811ed97' => 'Tomás Ribeiro',
	'k9915a30f' => 'Contract clients only, billed per hour; parts extra.',
	'k9a244fa7' => 'Second-year apprentice technician<br>Learning the plant on the roofs<br>beside Tomás and Samuel',
	'k9a42c34d' => 'The November visit executes the annual heating changeover, tuning burner or heat-pump controls and securing dampers against winter drafts. During each visit, our technicians replace air filters, lubricate bearings, test fan belts, clear drain trays, and conduct F-gas certified refrigerant inspections. Annual quarterly coverage starts at 2,400 euros for buildings with up to four units.',
	'k9b299c14' => 'Walk the building with the facilities manager and the existing log.',
	'k9cf4d344' => 'All quarterly items',
	'k9e383097' => 'Marta Kowalska',
	'k9e57990b' => 'Notice period',
	'k9edfa133' => 'Starts 08:00–15:00',
	'k9f0caf7e' => 'Who comes',
	'k9fd9f9cc' => 'Survey',
	'k9fdd5aad' => 'Buildings',
	'ka10a9bcd' => 'Legal',
	'ka13734dd' => 'Maintenance contracts · commercial buildings · Rotterdam',
	'ka1b45855' => 'We use your operational data exclusively to schedule maintenance attendances, issue survey engineering reports, deliver our quarterly Seasonal Checklist, and transmit quarterly invoices. Kuki Climate never sells, leases, or trades commercial or personal data with external third parties or marketing brokers. Technical service logs are retained for the duration of your maintenance agreement and subsequent statutory accounting periods required by Dutch commercial law. Facilities managers and business representatives may inspect, correct, or request the removal of their personal contact records by writing to accounts@kukiclimate.example. Formal requests are processed by our administrative team in Rotterdam within thirty days, subject to our statutory obligations regarding refrigeration records.',
	'ka26fa940' => 'Samuel Mensah',
	'ka273f1bc' => 'What happens next',
	'ka286d999' => 'Join',
	'ka301b317' => 'Our commercial maintenance pricing is structured around unit counts and required visit frequencies. All amounts exclude VAT at 21%.',
	'ka3335800' => 'Priority call-out for contract clients',
	'ka3558e47' => 'Contact · Koelhuisweg 14, Rotterdam',
	'ka36eb4e3' => '€320 / year',
	'ka3c34b99' => 'Heating changeover: controls tuned and dampers set for winter.',
	'ka3f822d2' => 'March, June, September and November.',
	'ka3fbf638' => '€95 / hour',
	'ka5a2ccc8' => 'Invoiced quarterly, payable in 30 days',
	'ka9b66b76' => 'Maintenance Contracts',
	'kab7cf06d' => 'Quarterly or monthly, month by month',
	'kace9ba00' => 'Monthly visits',
	'kad812611' => 'The €190 survey fee, credited to year one',
	'kadc66a06' => '4 hours',
	'kadec6035' => 'We spend 60 minutes on your roof and in your plant room with a contract manager and a technician: every unit, its nameplate and condition, the controls and the existing log. A written report follows within 3 working days.',
	'kb0fa507b' => 'High occupancy also creates sudden thermal spikes during dining rushes or peak trading hours. We schedule preventative maintenance during early morning hours before doors open to trade. Technicians clear condensate trays, sanitize evaporator coils, and inspect fan motors to eliminate equipment noise, prevent ceiling drip damage, and ensure continuous air quality across busy public spaces.',
	'kb18740d6' => 'The first contract visit fell in March, the month a year starts for us.',
	'kb221e496' => 'We outline simple visual checks for condensate drip trays to ensure drainage traps remain clear of algae and debris during peak humidity. You will also learn how to monitor thermostat sensor drift, identify unusual fan belt squeal or bearing vibration, and check that rooftop access hatches remain sealed against driving rain.',
	'kb35917f7' => 'Managing engineer, since 2009',
	'kb36a77c8' => 'What a year covers',
	'kb488986a' => 'Monthly, 13–30 units',
	'kb5841fc2' => 'Subscribing to our quarterly checklist keeps your internal facilities team informed, proactive, and aligned with sound engineering practices.',
	'kb621c5c8' => 'Booking Your 60-Minute Survey Hour',
	'kb6d5e7fa' => 'Kuki Climate maintains mechanical plant across diverse commercial properties within a 60-kilometre radius of Rotterdam. We tailor visit frequencies and service procedures to the operational demands of corporate offices, customer-facing hospitality premises, and sensitive educational or clinical facilities.',
	'kb90caa62' => 'Survey hours and proposals',
	'kb952e934' => 'Contract attendance schedules follow agreed quarterly or monthly visit intervals. For unscheduled service requests, Kuki Climate maintains an operational target of attending on site within four hours during normal weekday operational hours between 07:00 and 19:00. Unscheduled out-of-hours attendances for active contract holders are billed at 95 euros per hour excl. VAT, with replacement parts charged at direct cost. Maintenance fees are invoiced in equal quarterly instalments payable within thirty days of the invoice date. All prices are stated in euros and exclude Dutch value added tax at twenty-one percent. Clients are responsible for providing safe roof access, plant room keys, and necessary electrical isolation during all scheduled and emergency attendances.',
	'kb9fc9da1' => 'Service desk coordinator<br>Books every visit and takes the call<br>Monday to Friday, 07:30 to 17:30',
	'kba714904' => 'Walk the building with the facilities manager and read the existing service log, so we start from what you already know.',
	'kbae0627c' => 'What a maintenance year covers',
	'kbb4dd0ae' => 'The hour',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbc23435f' => 'The Seasonal checklist',
	'kbcca2994' => '€320 / €560 per year',
	'kbe92c627' => 'Quarterly',
	'kbf80ae75' => 'Filter change',
	'kc06046de' => 'The year',
	'kc1068414' => 'Autumn heating changeover',
	'kc13308bd' => 'Facilities managers and building operators can reach our service desk by telephone at +31 10 555 0140 or via email at desk@kukiclimate.example. Service desk coordinator Marta Kowalska oversees daily communications, schedules maintenance visits, logs client inquiries, and coordinates parts procurement.',
	'kc17a9afe' => 'Service area',
	'kc1e5fe67' => 'Recommended contract: quarterly or monthly',
	'kc288061f' => 'The same twelve visits for a larger plant, every unit logged.',
	'kc3755e61' => 'Call',
	'kc4085e4a' => 'A quarterly contract distributes maintenance across four scheduled visits each year in March, June, September, and November. The March visit prepares cooling systems for warmer weather, verifying compressor staging, testing safety switches, and inspecting electrical connections. June brings mid-season checks focusing on condenser cleanliness, filter condition, and condensate drainage during peak cooling demands. In September, technicians evaluate late-summer component wear and clean heat exchange surfaces.',
	'kc49ae7ba' => 'Contract clients can call the 24/7 line. The charge is €95 an hour plus parts. Our target is to be on site within 4 hours on weekdays 07:00–19:00, and the next morning otherwise.',
