	'kd2bba144' => 'Information We Collect and Process',
	'kd2bcf966' => 'All maintenance contracts are entered into for an initial term of twelve months. Either party may terminate the agreement at the conclusion of the twelve-month period by providing at least sixty days advance written notice. In the absence of such notice, contracts renew automatically for subsequent twelve-month periods under identical terms. Preliminary site surveys are billed at the fixed rate of 190 euros excl. VAT. This survey fee is credited in full against the client\'s first annual contract invoice upon execution of a formal maintenance agreement within thirty days of report delivery. Quotations provided in survey reports remain binding and valid for thirty days following issuance by our contract manager.',
	'kd2d51cc0' => 'Buildings We Maintain',
