	'ke412508b' => 'Notes at the table: the risks we found and what a maintenance year would cover.',
	'ke4881546' => 'Survey Requests and Accounts',
	'ke52d867e' => 'The log is written into the binder and the shared PDF.',
	'ke6b5fab2' => 'Second year',
	'ke7508f25' => 'To deliver commercial maintenance services, conduct technical surveys, and coordinate emergency dispatch, Kuki Climate B.V. collects necessary operational and contact details. This information includes client business names, building addresses within our 60-kilometre service territory, designated facilities manager names, direct telephone numbers, and email contacts. We also record technical building data, such as HVAC equipment nameplates, serial numbers, operational logs, and site access protocols. Records are stored securely at our Koelhuisweg 14 depot and within our secure digital service desk system. Equipment logs and shared PDF maintenance records are maintained strictly to document asset health and ensure regulatory F-gas compliance over the lifespan of your mechanical installations.',
	'ke8132ad9' => 'Monthly controls reading',
	'ke87e3575' => 'F-gas certified',
	'ke92081ab' => 'Two air handling units and six ceiling cassettes. Filter pressure is read and logged at every visit and the cassette drains are flushed on a rota, so the consulting rooms stay quiet and the readings stay comparable from month to month.',
	'ke938f787' => 'Briefing at the depot on Koelhuisweg: schedules, parts, access notes.',
	'keab99ec6' => 'Out-of-hours call-out',
	'kead23976' => 'Last year’s service records and F-gas logs, if you have them',
	'kec3e074e' => 'In educational facilities, major seasonal changeovers and filter replacements are scheduled during school holidays to avoid interfering with lessons. In clinical settings, monthly checks verify HEPA filter pressure drops, drain tray disinfection, and precise digital thermostat calibration. These disciplined routines protect vulnerable occupants while keeping ventilation equipment compliant with Dutch health standards.',
	'kec9ccfe7' => 'Contract Duration, Notice, and Survey Credits',
	'keca60ae8' => 'October',
	'kedcd15cc' => 'Offices of four to twelve floors<br>with rooftop units and a plant room<br>that tenants never want to think about',
	'kee6093dc' => 'Request a survey hour<br>Sixty minutes on your roof<br>and a written report in three days',
	'kefa034fb' => 'Three desks, one address',
	'kf0444a6f' => 'On site',
	'kf089d284' => 'The same four visits for a larger plant, every unit logged.',
	'kf1862177' => 'O',
	'kf1a116e6' => '€8,400 / year',
	'kf623e75a' => 'D',
	'kf90b6590' => 'Kuki Climate B.V.',
	'kfa0d9409' => 'What equipment do you maintain?',
	'kfa2ead69' => 'Privacy Policy',
	'kfa3e5eda' => 'March',
	'kfa81966f' => 'Major capital replacements, such as full compressor replacements or complete air-handling unit retrofits, fall outside regular maintenance and are quoted separately with clear engineering estimates. Every contract client receives a dedicated service record consisting of one physical binder left on site in the plant room and one shared digital PDF updated after each visit.',
	'kfacc4201' => 'Retail stores, restaurants, and hotels require climate systems that protect customer comfort without visible disruption. These venues frequently feature architectural linear ceiling grilles, compact split systems, and dedicated fresh-air ventilation integrated with commercial kitchen or lobby extraction. The primary operating challenge in retail and hospitality is heavy continuous footfall, which introduces significant dust, grease, and moisture into air filtration pathways.',
	'kfad86346' => 'Four visits a year for a medium plant installation: every unit tested, every reading logged.',
	'kfb1471ac' => 'Cooling start-up: compressor staging, safety switches, electrical connections.',
	'kfb48cf47' => 'Our working day follows a clear operational routine designed around building occupancy and weather. At 07:00, our technical team gathers at the Koelhuisweg depot for the morning briefing, reviewing site schedules, parts allocations, and access notes. Service vans depart at 07:30 to reach client locations across our 60-kilometre service area. Technicians tackle rooftop units and exposed plant early in the morning before summer heat makes condenser decks punishing.',
	'kfcae5cd1' => 'Following receipt of your request, our team calls back within two working days to confirm logistics and access arrangements. For billing inquiries, VAT documentation, or electronic invoice submissions, contact our finance team at accounts@kukiclimate.example.',
	'kfd711934' => 'Six floors, nine rooftop units, quarterly since 2019 and monthly from June to August. At the spring visit the log showed a bearing running warm on unit 4. It was replaced in April, before the first hot week, and the note went into the binder.',
	'kfd7e0375' => 'Plant kept<br>in service,<br>all year round.',
	'kfef7c43c' => '12 visits a year · from €8,400',
